        rocketObby_january: "January",
        rocketObby_sheep_desc: "Use rocket jumps to beat challenging maps! This map is the easiest.",
        rocketObby_january_desc: "Use rocket jumps to beat challenging maps! This map is a little harder.",
        survivalDescription: "Fight for survival in multiplayer (smp) worlds by looting, fighting and protecting land or create your own private server for free.",
        creativeDescription: "Be as creative as you wish by building freely with infinite blocks and custom tools. Start your own free build server to create with friends online.",
        bloxdHopDescription: "Bloxd hop is where it all began a pure parkour rush through floating blocks, tight jumps and checkpoints that built the world of bloxd one leap at a time.",
        cubeWarfareDescription: "Cube warfare throws you into nonstop firefights where sharp aim and fast movement mean the difference between top frag and instant respawn.",
        evilTowerDescription: "Evil tower dares you to climb through chaos where every floor gets trickier, every jump feels cursed, and one mistake can send you all the way back.",
        doodleCubeDescription: "Doodle cube blends build battle energy with party-style creativity: race through themes, craft on the fly, and let votes crown the boldest build.",
        oneBlockDescription: "Survive on one block in the sky and expand your world through unique phases as you collect, craft, and build your island into an empire.",
        skyWarsDescription: "Skywars throws you into high-stakes battles across floating islands where quick looting, risky pushes and sharp plays are your only way to survive.",
        plotsDescription: "Plots gives you your own slice of the world to shape, share, and show off starting with a blank canvas for building whatever, wherever, with whoever.",
        piratesDescription: "Set sail in pirates and dive into chaotic sea fights where skill, timing and a little madness decide who rules the waves and who sinks trying.",
        greenvilleDescription: "Step into greenville for a chill, social world where you can build a home, earn coins, play mini-games and live the laid-back sandbox life.",
        bedwarsDuosDescription: "Duo up in bedwars and face off on floating islands, where you and a teammate defend your bed, outsmart enemies, and break theirs to win.",
        bedwars4v4v4v4Description: "Squad up in bedwars, a pvp game where four-player teams battle on sky islands, defend their bed, and break enemy beds to win the match.",
        hideAndSeekDescription: "Blend into the map in hide & seek, a tense and playful match where disappearing works until the seekers catch on or catch you.",
        infectionDescription: "Don’t get infected... or do. infection throws players into a suspenseful match where the virus spreads fast and anyone could turn against you.",
        peacefulDescription: "Peaceful is a calm sandbox where you explore, build, and gather, with no hostile mobs and no health bar for stress-free play.",
        bedwarsSolosDescription: "Challenge bedwars solo and battle alone on sky islands, protect your bed at all costs, gather gear, and destroy enemy beds to be the last player standing.",
        luckyTowersDescription: "jump into lucky towers for fast and chaotic pvp where anything can happen, your gear is random and only one player survives the madness.",
        rocketSpleefDescription: "Blast into aerial mayhem in rocket spleef where explosions, gliders and pure luck collide in a sky brawl that never touches the ground.",
        bingoDescription: "Race to fill the board in bingo where fast thinking, lucky finds and risky detours turn every round into a frantic scavenger sprint.",
        paintballDescription: "Charge into the chaos of paintball where speed, splashes, and sharp aim turn every round into a fight for color and control.",
        bridgeDescription: "Every second counts in bridge, a back-and-forth battle where you build, defend, and sprint across your own bridge to score before they do.",
        bedwarsTriosDescription: "Team up in bedwars Trio, a pvp game where three-player squads battle on floating islands, protect their bed, and destroy opponents to claim victory.",
